pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">고지서 출력기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 1. 4.(월) 10시&nbsp;~ 1. 7.(목) [4일간]</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#ff6600\">2010. 1. 5(화) ~ 1. 7(목) [3일간]</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록장소 : 농협중앙회 전국&nbsp;각 지점 (고지서 지참)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#000000\"> </font>\n</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 등록여부 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> : 입금 당일 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">20:00시</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"> 이후</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #009900; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#339966\">고지서출력 바로가기 클릭 / 주민등록번호 입력</font> <font color=\"#0000ff\">시</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #99cc00; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">등록여부 확인 가능</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 문의전화 : 054) 478-7014~15</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2.<font color=\"#ff6600\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#000000\">등록기간에 미 등록시</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">개인별 통보없이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> <font color=\"#000000\">합격을 취소하며, 예비후보자로</font></span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> </span></font><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#000000\">충원되므로</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff1493; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#000000\">반드시 기간 내 등록하여야 합니다.<br></font></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><font face=\"굴림\">3. 출력되는 고지서는 2009학년도 기준으로 추후 등록금 인상시 추가 납부 금액이 발생 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><br><strong>4. 학자금 대출 문의: 1666-5114 (한국장학재단 대표전화)<br><br><font color=\"#ff0000\">5. 신입생의 경우 등록금 분합납부는 불가합니다.</font></strong><br></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
